# Bundled neural weights are opaque binary blobs that ModelRegistry verifies by
# SHA-256 at load time. `binary` expands to `-diff -merge -text`, so a checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true on Windows can never rewrite the bytes and break the
# manifest checksum (which would silently demote every model to the classical
# fallback). Renormalize with: git add --renormalize .
*.onnx binary
